			<div class="content" id="post-content-4805147">
									

<p>To quote a classic:<br /></p>
<div style="text-align: center;">
<blockquote>
<p>ME: &quot;Trick or bear?&quot;<br />
NEIGHBOR: &quot;Bear?&quot;<br />
ME: &quot;HE HAS CHOSEN THE BEAR!&quot;<br />
[distant roar and sounds of clanking chains]<br />
- <a href="https://twitter.com/rolldiggity">Matt Roller</a></p>
</blockquote>
</div>
<hr />
<div style="text-align: center;">
<h3><span>~ <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/ralliston-s-authorpage">also check out the ralliston coolpage funpage or I *will* steal all of your cookies</a> ~</span></h3>
</div>
<hr />
<p>Anyway, this is stupid. This is beyond stupid. And it is supposed to be stupid.</p>
<p>The whole thing started as an inside joke between me, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/veralta" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6030962); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6030962&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608196151" alt="Veralta" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6030962)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/veralta" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6030962); return false;">Veralta</a></span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jakob17" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5884163); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5884163&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608196151" alt="Jakob17" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5884163)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jakob17" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5884163); return false;">Jakob17</a></span> on the SCPD Discord server. Though I usually don't really like articles that sprung out of stupid jokes, I just couldn't resist the urge to write this one.</p>
<p>Special thanks to these folks for critting this absolute monstrosity:<br />
<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/veralta" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6030962); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6030962&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608196151" alt="Veralta" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6030962)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/veralta" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6030962); return false;">Veralta</a></span> | <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pedagon" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5903100); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5903100&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608196151" alt="Pedagon" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5903100)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pedagon" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5903100); return false;">Pedagon</a></span> | <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chiifu" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6394107); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6394107&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608196151" alt="chiifu" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6394107)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chiifu" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6394107); return false;">chiifu</a></span> | <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/the-great-hippo" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3938622); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3938622&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608196151" alt="The Great Hippo" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3938622)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/the-great-hippo" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3938622); return false;">The Great Hippo</a></span> | <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/estrellayoshte" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3781861); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3781861&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608196151" alt="EstrellaYoshte" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3781861)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/estrellayoshte" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3781861); return false;">EstrellaYoshte</a></span> | <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/radioactiverads" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5053587); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5053587&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608196151" alt="RadioactiveRADS" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5053587)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/radioactiverads" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5053587); return false;">RadioactiveRADS</a></span> | <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/itsdenali" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4284264); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4284264&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608196151" alt="ItsDenali" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4284264)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/itsdenali" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4284264); return false;">ItsDenali</a></span> | <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wizzblizz" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6760712); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6760712&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608196151" alt="WizzBlizz" style="background-image:url(http://www.wi