<p><strong>Edit:</strong> +20 in seven hours?! That’s my personal best, thanks y’all &lt;3</p>
<p><strong>Edit 2:</strong> +30 in ten hours. What. The. Actual. Hell.</p>
<p><strong>Edit 3:</strong> +40 in a day. I physically cannot stress enough how this feels. I’ve been writing for four months now, not even dreaming of anything getting into the 30s. Yet, here I am, with a +40 article in a single day. Thank you all so much. It means a lot.</p>
<p><strong>Edit 4:</strong> The Bear is now translated into <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5464">Chinese</a>. This&#8230; this feels unreal.</p>
