<p><strong>Edit 7:</strong> +60. I am speechless.</p>
<p><strong>Edit 8:</strong> +70. This has no interest in being so highly rated 0_0</p>
<p><strong>Edit 9:</strong> +100. Jesus. What the hell. I&#8230; I never thought I'd get this far. I&#8230; thank you. From the bottom of my heart, thank you. &lt;3</p>
